### 1. Root & Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login Option 1: Direct JSON Login (Admin)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@university.edu",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

> {% 
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); 
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token); 
%}

### 3. Login Option 2: OAuth2 Password Form (Swagger / OAuth2 Client flow)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice.student@university.edu&password=StudentPassword123!

> {% client.global.set("student_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 4. Refresh Access Token using Refresh Token (From localStorage)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 5. Get Current Profile (Works with Bearer Header or Cookie)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Register a New Admin (Guarded by admin_secret)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "New Secondary Admin",
  "email": "new.admin@university.edu",
  "password": "NewAdminPass123!",
  "role": "admin",
  "admin_secret": "admin-secret-dev-key"
}

### 7. Logout (Clears HttpOnly Lax Cookie)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/logout

### 8. List Departments
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. List Courses (US1.3)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. List Campus Services (US1.3)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. List Campus Service Categories
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/services/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. List Active Surveys (US1.2)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/surveys?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Get Feedback Source Types (US1.2)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/sources/types
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Feedback Sources Summary Dashboard (US1.2 / US1.3)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/sources/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json
